From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(reporter): Color the mutant diffs in the GitHub Actions
 log

When the text log is written to php://stdout on GitHub Actions, the
mutant diffs are now colored with ANSI escape sequences (removed lines
in red, added lines in green, hunk headers in cyan), which the GitHub
Actions log viewer renders. The plain text file log is unchanged.

Fixes #2582
